ac_1 = "GetAsset, BalanceOf, TotalUnits, AccountOwner and GetPayerGrant in modules/layerxledger/keeper/views.go (planned) return the values of ReadAsset, ReadBalance, ReadTotalUnits, ReadAccountOwner and ReadPayerGrant (modules/lxphost/read.go:292-412) and leave the host store unchanged."
