ac_1 = "init in precompiles/layerxagent/streams/merge.go (planned) registers NewMergePrecompile for 0x0906 (precompiles/setup.go:71) through RegisterMergeConstructor (precompiles/setup.go:89), and it refuses keepers without LayerXPayKeepers in precompiles/layerxpay/keepers.go (planned)."
ac_2 = "The precompile built by NewMergePrecompile refuses every call below the plan height with LXP_AGENT_NOT_ACTIVE through HeightGate (precompiles/layerxagent/common/common.go:92), the merge gate that requires the layerxpay module for 0x0906 (node/upgrades.go:534)."

[req.2297]
title = "Serve the 0x0903 oracle aggregator with aggregate, submitPrice and getValidatorPrice"
ac_1 = "Aggregate in precompiles/layerxagent/oracle/oracle.go (planned) drops zero-confidence feeds, returns one feed as is, otherwise sorts by price and returns the first price whose cumulative confidence reaches floor(total/2) with the minimum kept confidence, the rule of spec/layerx-merge/contracts/agent-functions.md:76."
ac_2 = "aggregate (0x81097a95) refuses an empty list with LXP_AGENT_ORACLE_NO_FEEDS, all-zero confidence with LXP_AGENT_ORACLE_NO_CONFIDENT_FEEDS, a price <= 0 with LXP_AGENT_ORACLE_PRICE, confidence above the cap with LXP_AGENT_ORACLE_CONFIDENCE and more feeds than the cap with LXP_AGENT_BATCH_TOO_LARGE (precompiles/layerxagent/common/common.go:33-41)."
ac_3 = "submitPrice (0xdc9c2875) refuses a caller whose 0x1004 key is not in the market's permittedOracleKeys with LXP_AGENT_ORACLE_NOT_SIGNER, else writes one observation through the exchange keeper SubmitOracleObservation (wiring.J24.14), and getValidatorPrice (0x99812615) returns (committed price, quorum 1, observed_at / 1000)."

