ac_2 = "quoteMarket (precompiles/perps/quotes.go:26) registered at precompiles/perps/quotes.go:17 returns the ABI packing of QuoteMarket (modules/perps/keeper/quotes.go:263) for a resting BTC book, and refuses an unknown market with the PerpsUnknownMarket selector."

[req.3004]
