ac_2 = "For each error of RegisteredErrors, LXPReason (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:134) yields text starting LXP_PERPS_ and never LXP_UNKNOWN, while revertOf (precompiles/perps/errors.go:70-77) still returns the 4-byte custom-error selector."

[req.3005]
title = "Perps genesis validation at the module boundary"
ac_1 = "ValidateGenesis exported from modules/perps/keeper/genesis.go runs rebuildIndexes (modules/perps/keeper/genesis.go:108), types.ValidateGenesis (modules/perps/types/genesis.go:167) and matchSuppliedIndexes (modules/perps/keeper/genesis.go:160) and refuses a supplied book entry absent from the rebuilt index with ErrInvalidGenesis (modules/perps/types/errors.go:51)."
ac_2 = "ValidateGenesis accepts ExportGenesis (modules/perps/keeper/genesis.go:245) of a venue with open orders and positions, and initGenesis (modules/perps/keeper/genesis.go:36) calls it before setParams."
ac_3 = "AppModuleBasic.ValidateGenesis at modules/perps/module.go:52-58 calls keeper.ValidateGenesis, so a genesis with a supplied index absent from the rebuilt one fails at validate-genesis instead of panicking at InitGenesis (modules/perps/keeper/genesis.go:30)."
ac_4 = "After MsgUpdateParams, MsgSetMarket disabling ETH and MsgSetPaused true, ExportGenesis (modules/perps/keeper/genesis.go:245) then InitGenesis (modules/perps/keeper/genesis.go:30) into a fresh store reproduces the params, markets and Paused flag, and a second export is byte-identical."

[req.3006]
title = "Governance parameter changes take effect on the running venue"
ac_1 = "Withdrawable (modules/perps/keeper/account.go:207) keeps back notional times Params.WithdrawFloorPpm (modules/perps/types/params.go:68) divided by 1e6, rounded up, instead of the fixed accountNotionalFloorDivisor of modules/perps/keeper/account.go:16-18 used at modules/perps/keeper/account.go:231."
ac_2 = "With DefaultParams (modules/perps/types/params.go:97) Withdrawable returns the same value the fixed divisor of modules/perps/keeper/account.go:231 gives at HEAD."
ac_3 = "ExecuteADL (modules/perps/keeper/adl.go:90) matches at most Params.AdlPositionsPerBlock (modules/perps/types/params.go:79) counterparties per call instead of the constant adlCounterpartiesPerBlock of modules/perps/keeper/adl.go:15 used at modules/perps/keeper/adl.go:106."
ac_4 = "RankADL (modules/perps/keeper/adl.go:49) called with a limit above Params.AdlPositionsPerBlock returns at most AdlPositionsPerBlock positions."
ac_5 = "After MsgSetPaused true, LiquidationScan (modules/perps/keeper/liquidation.go:108) still liquidates an account below maintenance, because the pause gate of modules/perps/keeper/pause.go:24 covers precompile writes only."
ac_6 = "After MsgSetPaused true, SettleFunding (modules/perps/keeper/funding.go:158) still settles at the funding hour and emits FundingSettled."
ac_7 = "After MsgSetPaused true, crossedTriggers (modules/perps/keeper/triggers.go:134) collects only reduce-only trigger orders, so a stop-loss fires and an opening stop entry does not."
ac_8 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 lowers FundingCapPpmPerHour (modules/perps/types/params.go:62), hourlyRate (modules/perps/keeper/funding.go:222) clamps the next settled rate to the lower of the params cap and the market cap at modules/perps/keeper/funding.go:228-230."
ac_9 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 sets LiquidationsPerBlock to 1 (modules/perps/types/params.go:77), LiquidationScan stops at the cap check of modules/perps/keeper/liquidation.go:123 after one liquidation."
ac_10 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 replaces FeeTiers (modules/perps/types/params.go:56), FeeTier (modules/perps/keeper/fees.go:232) and chargeFee (modules/perps/keeper/fees.go:327) charge the new tier 0 taker rate on the next fill."
ac_11 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 replaces RebateTiers (modules/perps/types/params.go:57), the rebate loop at modules/perps/keeper/fees.go:273 pays the new maker rebate on the next fill."
ac_12 = "After MsgSetMarket sets Enabled false on ETH, PlaceOrder refuses a non-reduce-only order with ErrMarketDisabled at modules/perps/keeper/orders.go:77-78 and accepts a reduce-only close of an open ETH position."
ac_13 = "After MsgSetMarket raises OiCapUsd of BTC, OpenInterestCap (modules/perps/keeper/openinterest.go:57) returns the raised cap and CheckOpenInterest (modules/perps/keeper/openinterest.go:78) admits a fill it refused before with ErrOpenInterestCap."
ac_14 = "UpdateParams of modules/perps/keeper/msg_server.go (planned) refuses a MaxOpenOrdersPerAccount (modules/perps/types/params.go:87) below the largest OpenOrderCount of any account with ErrInvalidParams, because the invariant at modules/perps/keeper/invariants.go:216-219 would otherwise break."
ac_15 = "After MsgUpdateParams, MsgSetMarket and MsgSetPaused on a venue with orders and positions, every invariant registered by RegisterInvariants (modules/perps/keeper/invariants.go:44) reports no breach."
ac_16 = "After MsgSetMarket disables SOL, UpdatePrices skips it at modules/perps/keeper/mark.go:52 and no premium sample is written for SOL by SamplePremium (modules/perps/keeper/funding.go:41) at EndBlock."
ac_17 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 raises MinOrderValueUsd (modules/perps/types/params.go:83), checkOrderValue refuses a smaller order with ErrMinOrderValue at modules/perps/keeper/orders.go:312-314."
ac_18 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 replaces ClassEOiCaps (modules/perps/types/params.go:66), OpenInterestCap (modules/perps/keeper/openinterest.go:57) of a class E market returns the new row for its listing age."
ac_19 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 sets InsuranceSharePpm (modules/perps/types/params.go:58) to 500000, chargeFee sends half of each fee to the insurance fund at modules/perps/keeper/fees.go:346."
ac_20 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 changes BackstopRatioNumerator and BackstopRatioDenominator (modules/perps/types/params.go:72-73), belowBackstopLine (modules/perps/keeper/insurance.go:593) uses the new ratio at modules/perps/keeper/insurance.go:600-601."
ac_21 = "After MsgUpdateParams served by the perps msg server of task 3.1.4 changes MarkEmaSeconds (modules/perps/types/params.go:64), EndBlock passes the new value to updateMarketPrice at modules/perps/keeper/endblock.go:166 and the mark moves by the new smoothing weight."
ac_22 = "After MsgSetPaused true then MsgSetPaused false, PlaceOrder passes the pause gate at modules/perps/keeper/orders.go:63-64 and CheckPause (modules/perps/keeper/pause.go:24) admits openPosition again."
ac_23 = "After MsgSetMarket moves BTC from TierClassA to TierClassB, checkOrderLeverage (modules/perps/keeper/orders.go:339) refuses with ErrLeverageTooHigh an order whose leverage the class A tier allowed at the same notional."

