ac_1 = "Query/Quote{denom, is_buy, amount_in} returns the SwapQuote of QuoteBuy (modules/launchpad/keeper/swap.go:213) or QuoteSell (modules/launchpad/keeper/swap.go:218) with every field of SwapResult (modules/launchpad/keeper/swap.go:45-52) and writes no state."
