ac_1 = "Query/QuoteLedger{kind, address} returns GetQuoteLedger (modules/launchpad/keeper/custody.go:91) of HeldQuoteLedger(pool), FeeHeldLedger(accumulator) or TreasuryHeldLedger() (modules/launchpad/keeper/custody.go:63-71) chosen by ParseQuoteLedgerKind."
