ac_1 = "RegisterServices (modules/launchpad/module.go:98-100) registers keeper.NewQuerier(am.keeper) as the Query server beside the Msg server, so the module manager call at node/app.go:1133 serves /paxprotocol.paxchain.launchpad.Query/ methods."
ac_2 = "RegisterGRPCGatewayRoutes (modules/launchpad/module.go:75) calls types.RegisterQueryHandlerClient so ModuleBasics.RegisterGRPCGatewayRoutes at node/app.go:3026 mounts the 17 launchpad GET routes."

