ac_2 = "Against a one-validator chain from tests/testutil/network.New (tests/testutil/network/network.go:45) at DefaultGenesis, the commands answer through the node: market launchpad/0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 and market-by-address of the same address both fail with the unknown market code 12 of the launchpad codespace."

