ac_2 = "Against a one-validator chain from tests/testutil/network.New (tests/testutil/network/network.go:45) at DefaultGenesis, the commands answer through the node: markets --limit 10 prints an empty market list with total 0 and markets-by-creator of the validator account prints an empty list, while markets --limit 101 fails with code 30."

