ac_1 = "createMarket (modules/launchpad/keeper/market.go:138) emits launchpad_market_created (modules/launchpad/types/events.go:4) once per created market with attributes denom, pointer set to the TokenAddress, creator and strategy (modules/launchpad/types/events.go:20-22 and :36), placed before the return at modules/launchpad/keeper/market.go:224, as the v6.10 keeper does at modules/launchpad/legacy/v610/keeper/market.go:91-95."
