ac_1 = "For every error registered at modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:18-92, LXPRevert (precompiles/common/lxp_errors.go:339) of its Error() text yields a reason starting with that LXP_LAUNCHPAD_ code and not LXP_UNKNOWN, which holds once wiring.J28.1 adds the rows for codes 2, 24 and 30-75 after precompiles/common/lxp_errors.go:237."

[req.4045]
