ac_1 = "precompiles/launchpad/abi.json and precompiles/launchpad/Launchpad.sol declare as custom errors every contract error registered with newContractError at modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:166-232, which contractRevertData (precompiles/launchpad/errors.go:67) returns for the seven direct roles of precompiles/launchpad/abi_direct_test.go:13, while abi.json keeps its 113 functions and 12 events."

[req.4046]
