ac_2 = "An absent answer, pending or never requested, is LXP_UNKNOWN_FIELD as the kernel committed read returns it (src/modules/web/lx_web_intake.c:309-328)."
ac_3 = "A malformed committed answer, a header other than 40 bytes, a response length above 4096 or above the full length, or a missing or short chunk, is LXP_NON_CANONICAL (src/modules/web/lx_web_intake.c:330-368)."
ac_4 = "The read is keyed by (programId, requestId) (modules/xweb/keeper/program_fulfil.go:92), so the same request id under another program never returns a foreign answer."

