ac_1 = "VerifiedReplayAuthority::derive and derive_program_call (programs/crates/layerx-programs-arbiter/src/authority.rs:24 and :33) take a ChainCommitProof (planned) holding block height, app_hash and the ICS23 existence proof of the idempotent receipt entry instead of VerifiedBatchHeader and Proof, and return the same canonical authority bytes as at HEAD for the fixture receipt."
ac_2 = "derive returns ReplayError::Receipt when the receipt proof does not verify under the commit app_hash or proves a different receipt value, replacing the leaf_count and leaf_index checks of programs/crates/layerx-programs-arbiter/src/authority.rs:55-58."

[req.13285]
