ac_1 = "VerifiedReplay::verify and verify_with_batch_context (programs/crates/layerx-programs-arbiter/src/step.rs:432 and :409) take the program metadata entry as an ICS23 existence proof under ChainCommitProof.app_hash instead of a StateWitness and accept the fixture step."
ac_2 = "AuthenticatedCatalogue::verify_with_module (programs/crates/layerx-programs-arbiter/src/step.rs:259) proves each module 9 code blob entry by ICS23 under the app hash and returns ReplayError::Catalogue for a blob whose proof does not verify."

