kcs-generatedreceiptcontract-programoutcomev4", "interface.8.go-sdkcs-generatedreceiptcontract-requirednonzerochecks", "interface.8.go-sdkcs-generatedreceiptcontract-machinecode"]
do_1 = "sdk/platform/dotnet/Verifier.cs verifies kernel canonical receipts against an AuthorizedBatch today (sdk/platform/dotnet/Verifier.cs:36 record; sdk/platform/dotnet/Verifier.cs:136 record; sdk/platform/dotnet/Verifier.cs:138 record; sdk/platform/dotnet/Verifier.cs:164 record; sdk/platform/dotnet/Verifier.cs:196 record); add LocalVerifier.VerifySequencerReceipt(receiptBytes, rawTransaction, keys) and the ReceiptKeys type implementing spec/layerx-merge/contracts/clients.md:163-168 R2-R6: decode with byte-exact re-encode, receipt version 2 or 3, non-zero activity_id, ed25519 over sha256(\"LXP/v1/receipt\\0\" || unsigned preimage)."
do_2 = "In sdk/platform/dotnet/Verifier.cs check that context_hash equals a keyId of the pinned ReceiptKeys list (primary or standby) and that the batch_id height lies inside that key's [firstHeight, lastHeight] (spec/layerx-merge/contracts/clients.md:165), that activity_id equals keccak256 of the raw transaction (spec/layerx-merge/contracts/clients.md:166), and that seqHash = sha256(\"PAXEER/v1/sequence\\0\" || prevSeqHash || u64be(seq) || activity_id) (spec/layerx-merge/contracts/clients.md:168)."
do_3 = "Regenerate sdk/platform/dotnet/Generated/ReceiptContract.cs from the [receipt] section that task 8.45.1 rewrites (sdk/platform/dotnet/Generated/ReceiptContract.cs:6 ReceiptCheck; sdk/platform/dotnet/Generated/ReceiptContract.cs:8 Decode,; sdk/platform/dotnet/Generated/ReceiptContract.cs:9 CanonicalEncoding,): the ReceiptCheck values become decode, canonical-encoding, receipt-version, activity-id, key-id, key-height, raw-transaction, fields, return-data, logs, sequence-hash and signature; the programs module id 9 and the outcome tags 0x50524731-0x50524734 are removed."
do_4 = "Decode JSON status 0 as a receipted revert and surface the Error(string) \"LXP_<code>\" reason from returnData as a typed revert, never as a verification failure (spec/layerx-merge/contracts/clients.md:171)."
do_5 = "Create sdk/platform/dotnet/tests/LayerX.Sdk.Tests/SequencerReceiptTests.cs (planned) reading sdk/platform/conformance/fixtures/sequencer-receipt-v1.json:1 cases V1, V2 and V3 through LocalVerifier.VerifySequencerReceipt."
