do_4 = "services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/sign.rs:324 `verify_before_submit` decodes the raw bytes with `decode_signed` (services/agent/crates/layerx-crypto/src/evm_transaction.rs:241) and checks that the decoded call equals Prepared.call; services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/sign_verify.rs:3 drops the ed25519 import and services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/sign_verify.rs:56 `attach_signature` and :65 `verify_exact` work on the EIP-1559 raw bytes."
