do_4 = "Verify the signed receipt with `verify_sequencer_signature` (services/agent/crates/layerx-proof/src/receipt.rs:666) under `ReceiptKeys::HeightRanges` and refuse a receipt whose activity id differs from the decoded hash, before any evidence leaves the relay."
